==Battleground==
*1 [[Axoloty]] spawns as the boss.
*5 [[Axoloty|Axoloties]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam Lv.44+ [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cats]]. They have enough damage to kill the Axoloties and destroy the base before the Assassin Bears spawn. If you lack the levels, use Attack Up [[Cat Combo]]s to make up the difference.

==Trivia==
*A [[wikipedia:Trompo|trompo]] is a top spun by winding a length of string around the body, and launching it so that lands spinning on its point.
*Trompo Foothills' Japanese name, Butsukegoma Kyūryō (ぶつけゴマ丘陵, "Hitting Top Hills"), is a pun on ぶつける ''butsukeru'' (bumping; hitting) and ベイゴマ ''[[wikipedia:Beigoma|beigoma]]'' (a type of spinning top that makes a humming sound when spun).

